			"Message": "style(Worker): Escape emoji characters to prevent markdown rendering issues\n\nWrap the Land (🍩) and Mountain (🏞️) project emoji icons in HTML numeric character references (`&#x2001;`) within the README.md header table. This prevents potential markdown parser inconsistencies where raw emoji characters might be interpreted or styled unexpectedly across different rendering engines.\n\nThe change preserves the visual iconography while ensuring strict source-level compatibility and consistent rendering in all GitHub environments without altering the semantic content or layout.",
